Fashion House - Mongoose Models Implementation

STATUS: COMPLETE

Models Created (9 files in backend/models/):
- User.js - User authentication and profile
- Category.js - Product categories
- Product.js - Products with variants and images
- Cart.js - Shopping cart
- Order.js - Order management
- Payment.js - Payment processing
- Shipment.js - Shipping and tracking
- Review.js - Product reviews
- Wishlist.js - User wishlist

All models follow the project specification:
- JavaScript only (no TypeScript)
- ES Modules with Mongoose
- Reuses existing MongoDB connection
- Proper indexes and unique constraints
- Embedded schemas where appropriate
- Decimal128 for monetary values
- Timestamps on all models
- Ready for next development phase